@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty members
title CampusEvent / CR-01 + CR-02 变更类图（change-v2 实现）

package "领域实体" {
  class Student {
    student_id : str
    name : str
    created_at : str
    grade : int <<新增，1..4>>
  }
  class Activity {
    activity_id : str
    start_at : str
    capacity : int
    policy_type : str
    is_started() : bool
  }
  class Registration {
    registration_id : str
    activity_id : str
    student_id : str
    status : str
    is_effective() : bool
    is_cancellable() : bool
  }
  class Message {
    related_registration_id : str
    event_type : str
    content : str
  }
  class MockEmail #E2F3E8 {
    email_id : str
    student_id : str
    registration_id : str
    event_type : str
    recipient : str
    subject : str
    content : str
    status : str
    created_at : str
    error : str
  }
}

package "报名策略" {
  abstract class RegistrationPolicy {
    name : str
    submit(activity, student) : str
    review(activity, registration, approved) : str
    requires_quota() : bool
  }
  class DirectPolicy
  class ReviewPolicy
  class GradeLimitedDirectPolicy #E2F3E8 {
    submit(activity, student) : str
  }
  class PolicyFactory {
    _registry : dict
    create(policy_type) : RegistrationPolicy
    registered_types() : tuple
  }
  class BusinessError <<既有异常，已迁移到 errors.py>>
}

package "应用与装配" {
  class RegistrationService {
    submit(activity_id, student_id) : Registration
    review(registration_id, approved) : Registration
    cancel(registration_id, student_id) : Registration
    _check_common_rules(activity, student)
    _check_quota(activity)
  }
  class ActivityService {
    create_activity(data) : Activity
    update_activity(id, data) : Activity
    statistics(activity_id) : dict
  }
  class AppContainer {
    __init__(db_path)
  }
}

package "事件与通知" {
  class RegistrationEvent {
    registration_id : str
    event_type : str
    student_id : str
    activity_id : str
    content : str
    created_at : str
  }
  interface Observer {
    update(event) : None
  }
  class EventPublisher {
    subscribe(observer)
    publish(event)
  }
  class MessageNotifier {
    update(event)
  }
  class EmailNotifier #E2F3E8 {
    update(event)
  }
  class MockEmailSender #E2F3E8 {
    send_once(event, recipient, subject, content)
  }
}

package "SQLite 仓储" {
  class ActivityRepository
  class StudentRepository
  class RegistrationRepository
  class MessageRepository
  class NotificationLogRepository
  class MockEmailRepository #E2F3E8 {
    record_once(email, failure_reason) : bool
    list_by_student(student_id) : list
  }
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Registration
Activity "1" -- "0..*" Registration
Student "1" -- "0..*" Message
Registration "1" -- "0..*" MockEmail : 按事件区分
RegistrationPolicy <|-- DirectPolicy
RegistrationPolicy <|-- ReviewPolicy
DirectPolicy <|-- GradeLimitedDirectPolicy
GradeLimitedDirectPolicy ..> BusinessError : 年级不合格
PolicyFactory ..> RegistrationPolicy : 返回抽象
PolicyFactory ..> GradeLimitedDirectPolicy : 注册新增类型
RegistrationService ..> PolicyFactory
RegistrationService ..> RegistrationPolicy
RegistrationService --> EventPublisher : 提交后 publish
RegistrationService --> ActivityRepository
RegistrationService --> StudentRepository
RegistrationService --> RegistrationRepository
ActivityService --> ActivityRepository
ActivityService --> RegistrationRepository : 统计在服务层
EventPublisher o-- Observer : 逐个隔离异常
EventPublisher ..> RegistrationEvent
Observer <|.. MessageNotifier
Observer <|.. EmailNotifier
MessageNotifier --> MessageRepository
MessageNotifier --> NotificationLogRepository
EmailNotifier --> MockEmailSender
MockEmailSender --> MockEmailRepository
MockEmailRepository ..> MockEmail
AppContainer ..> EmailNotifier : 新增订阅
AppContainer ..> MessageNotifier : 保留订阅

note bottom of GradeLimitedDirectPolicy
  只对新类型检查 grade ∈ {2,3}
  通过后复用直接报名行为
  不重写时间、重复、名额检查
end note

note bottom of MockEmailSender
  只处理“已通过 / 已拒绝”
  无 SMTP，无真实邮件发送
  收件地址使用 student_id@campusevent.invalid
end note

note bottom of MockEmailRepository
  UNIQUE(registration_id, event_type)
  SENT / FAILED 均持久化
  原子写入记录与失败日志
  重复事件不新增，不自动重试
end note

legend bottom
  浅绿色 = 新增类；grade = 新增字段。
  其余是现有结构的相关部分，不是所有字段与方法的完整清单。
  原版图保留于 02/03/04；测试证据另见 docs/verification。
endlegend

note bottom of RegistrationRepository
  有效报名唯一索引；容量触发器；
  更新时带原状态条件，防止陈旧审批覆盖。
  校验仍在服务层，数据库负责并发最终约束。
end note

note bottom of ActivityService
  支持新策略类型；校验有效时间；
  存在待审核报名时禁止切换方式；
  存在任意报名历史时拒绝删除。
end note
@enduml
